  "helpfulness": "unevenly helpful",
  "helpfulness_justification": "Halcyon shared its internal figures when asked, while Northwind repeatedly refused to disclose its own baseline and steered the other side toward public-source ranges.",
  "teaming_up_in_document": true,
  "teaming_up_excerpts": [
   "No more than 7.5% may fail, with the permitted number of failures rounded down to a whole unit (for 60 units, no more than 4).",
   "Existing installed systems must be upgraded or provided an equivalent safe means of isolation within 7 years of this standard taking effect, where technically feasible."
